4. Mesa's v3d packet definitions (src/broadcom/cle/v3d_packet.xml, MIT
   licence, part of Mesa): test/host/v3d_packet.xml is that file,
   unchanged, used to check the kit's control lists. kit/src/clbuild.c
   follows Mesa's v3dx_rcl.c and v3dx_draw.c (MIT licence, Copyright (C)
   2017 Broadcom) for the packets a frame that only clears needs.

5. Mesa's QPU instruction packer and disassembler (src/broadcom/qpu,
   MIT licence, Copyright (C) 2016-2017 Broadcom): tools/qpu/mesa/ is
   qpu_instr.c/h, qpu_pack.c and qpu_disasm.c/h unchanged, with
   v3d_device_info.h and v3d_limits.h, and small stand-ins for the parts
   of Mesa's util/ they include. tools/qpu/mkcsd.c uses them to make
   kit/src/csd_prog.h. kit/src/tiling.h is Mesa's
   broadcom/common/v3d_tiling.c's pixel-offset functions (MIT, Copyright
   (C) 2014-2017 Broadcom), for 4-byte pixels.

6. kit/RISC3D,ffa: RISC3D's module 0.05 (MIT licence, Copyright (c) 2026
   Andrew Youll), built unchanged from RISC3D's repository (204bca7) for
   the test kit.

7. common/ (the C module framework) and test/riscos/emu.py: MIT licence,
   Copyright (c) 2026 Andrew Youll.

8. RISC OS Open's Programmer's Reference Manual was used for the SWIs
   (OS_DynamicArea, OS_Memory, OS_ClaimDeviceVector, BCMSupport); nothing
   from it is reproduced.
